衣草紫渐变，层层叠加，仿佛紫藤花串倾泻而下。上身为精致收腰剪裁，胸口采用花瓣交叠式设计，不暴露，肩部与手臂覆盖半透明薄纱，紫藤花刺绣沿领口、腰线自然蔓延。裙摆点缀细小花蕊与微光珠饰，整体色调以象牙白、淡紫、薰衣草紫为主，画面柔和、圣洁、优雅，充满春日气息\n\n双手比心，\n站姿优雅，高跟鞋，\n\n双手手指清晰可见，数量正确，结构自然，比例自然合理，\n双脚自然放松，形态不变形，结构自然，比例自然合理，\n高质量细节表现，合理人体比例，画面干净，无夸张或错误结构\n\nbare legs,\ndetailed fingers,detailed eyes,白皙透红皮肤，\nclean composition, sharp focus, high resolution, professional artwork\n"], "inputs": [{"name": "clip", "link": 69, "label": "clip", "type": "CLIP", "localized_name": "clip"}, {"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "type": "CLIPTextEncode", "title": "CLIP Text Encode (Positive Prompt)", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#353", "size": [427.7530517578125, 217.9172821044922], "pos": [389.3320007324219, 186.83973693847656], "id": 6, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.3.43", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "CLIPTextEncode"}, "order": 8}], "extra": {"VHS_KeepIntermediate": true, "links_added_by_ue": [], "VHS_MetadataImage": true, "ue_links": [], "0246.VERSION": [0, 0, 4], "VHS_latentpreviewrate": 0, "frontendVersion": "1.30.6", "VHS_latentpreview": false, "ds": {"offset": [276.18499144169857, 81.52513590257337], "scale": 1.7088742511245865}}, "groups": [], "links": [[42, 16, 0, 11, 0, "MODEL"], [61, 17, 0, 30, 1, "VAE"], [62, 30, 0, 9, 0, "IMAGE"], [64, 6, 0, 3, 1, "CONDITIONING"], [65, 7, 0, 3, 2, "CONDITIONING"], [66, 13, 0, 3, 3, "LATENT"], [68, 18, 0, 32, 1, "CLIP"], [69, 32, 1, 6, 0, "CLIP"], [70, 32, 1, 7, 0, "CLIP"], [71, 32, 0, 3, 0, "MODEL"], [72, 32, 0, 34, 0, "MODEL"], [73, 6, 0, 34, 1, "CONDITIONING"], [74, 7, 0, 34, 2, "CONDITIONING"], [75, 3, 0, 34, 3, "LATENT"], [76, 34, 0, 30, 0, "LATENT"], [77, 11, 0, 35, 0, "MODEL"], [78, 35, 0, 32, 0, "MODEL"]], "id": "3a36bb0a-bc5d-477f-93e1-7272606ed4bf", "config": {}, "version": 0.4, "last_node_id": 37, "revision": 0}